      en: ["The area was recognized as a UNESCO Biosphere Reserve in 1977.", "It protects the last 16,000 hectares of Acacia raddiana forest in Tunisia.", "The highest point of the massif stands at approximately 790 meters.", "Over 100 Scimitar-horned oryx have been successfully reintroduced since 1985.", "The total protected area covers roughly 16,488 hectares.", "The average annual temperature in the park is around 19 degrees Celsius."],
